<h1>Testimonials</h1>
<blockquote>
    <p>I've trained both myself and clients utilizing power meters, heart rate monitors, and other tools and devices to help improve performance. I was simply blown away by the results of this initial testing of the GPS Trainer. I think the potential as a training and racing tool is huge, and I look forward to utilizing it both for myself and my clients.</p>
    <p>— W. Burt Henry, CSCS, USA Cycling Elite Level Coach</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
    <p>I've had a couple of opportunities to do workouts with the gpsTrainer's developer. The process of creating a race course was simple. For racing the course, we set the gpsTrainer so it would tell me every 10 seconds whether I was ahead or behind the target time. It was almost like having a training partner to race. That made the intervals fun and motivated me to push much harder.</p>
    <p>— Jim Murdock, national champion sprinter</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
    <p>What a cool invention! I love riding with the gpsTrainer. It gives great updates, letting me know how I am doing right now, rather than just at the end of the race or at the top of the climb.</p>
    <p>— Larry Maple</p>
</blockquote>
